#ROOMDATA
#2900
The Trial Lobby~
A circular antechamber of polished grey stone.  Eight sealed archways ring
the walls, each humming faintly with contained violence.  This is the staging
ground for the Class Trials: a series of solo proving-grounds where a warrior
faces escalating foes to sharpen the skills of their chosen path.

The Trial Master waits here.  Speak with them ('quest trial') to begin.
Go up to return to the world.
~
0 10752 1
D4
You see the way back out to the world.
~
~
